<header class="overview-intro"><div><p class="overview-eyebrow">STUDENT RECORDS</p><h1>Student Records overview</h1><p>Manage enrollment information and review verification activity.</p></div><a class="button" href="<?= site_url('admin/students') ?>">Manage students</a></header>
<div class="overview-metrics"><article class="overview-metric"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">school</span><small>Total students</small><strong><?= (int)$total ?></strong></article><article class="overview-metric"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">how_to_reg</span><small>Enrolled students</small><strong><?= (int)$enrolled ?></strong></article><article class="overview-metric"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">person_off</span><small>Not enrolled</small><strong><?= max(0,(int)$total-(int)$enrolled) ?></strong></article><article class="overview-metric"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">fact_check</span><small>Verification events</small><strong><?= (int)$successful+(int)$unsuccessful ?></strong></article><article class="overview-metric"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">pending_actions</span><small>Assistance awaiting review</small><strong><?= (int)$requestCounts['pending']+(int)$requestCounts['under_review'] ?></strong></article></div>
